  "goodToKnow": "Archivieren means to archive: Dokumente, Daten, E-Mails archivieren. German businesses must keep accounting records for several years under the Aufbewahrungspflicht, typically six to ten depending on the document. Das Archiv is an archive, der Archivar an archivist. The Bundesarchiv in Koblenz holds federal records, including those of the Stasi since 2021. Perfect without ge-: hat archiviert."
